        "title": "Political Reformers - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Political reform is the systematic alteration of how power is distributed, constrained, or exercised within a society. The figures in this directory span 2,600 years of that project — from Solon restructuring Athenian debt to Zelensky defending democratic sovereignty against authoritarian aggression. What unites them is not ideology but *mechanism*: each figured out a lever to pull that changed the rules of the political game."
    },
