      "text": "```\n  REFORMER                REVOLUTIONARY             NEGOTIATOR\n  --------                -------------             ----------\n  Works within system     Breaks existing           Builds consensus\n  Expands rights,         system to replace         across deep\n  extends franchise,      it entirely               divides in\n  reduces arbitrary                                 terminal or\n  power                   May impose new            transition phase\n                          constraints\n  Examples:               afterward                 Examples:\n  Solon, Lincoln,                                   Mandela, Havel,\n  FDR, Attlee,            Examples:                 Adenauer,\n  Gladstone, Bolivar      Cromwell, Lenin,          Gorbachev\n                          Mao, Castro\n```"
    },
